; The variable: ssao_enabled. A corner of two walls and a floor, with a cube in it, lit only by a
; white ambient light, so every shade is the screen-space occlusion: it darkens the seams and the
; ground around the cube. No other golden enables SSAO: with it off every face draws one grey.
